OL,3,GNEWSASeven arrests after e-scooters
OL,4,Astolen in city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been arrested after
OL,7,Ftwo e-scooter riders were robbed in
OL,8,FNottingham city centre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the two
OL,11,Fvictims were riding through London Road
OL,12,FIsland at about 21:20 BST on Monday
OL,13,Fwhen they were approached by a group.
OL,15,FOne rider was pushed from his e-scooter
OL,16,Fbefore it was stolen, the force added,
OL,17,Fand after the other resisted, one
OL,18,Fmember of the group "produced a bladed
OL,19,Fweapon and threatened to stab him".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
