OL,3,GNEWSASeven arrests after e-scooters
OL,4,Astolen in city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to police, three people
OL,7,Fmatching the suspects' description were
OL,8,Ffound in the Angel Row area soon
OL,9,Fafterwards, and one e-scooter was
OL,10,Frecovered from a property on Meredith
OL,11,FClose in The Meadows, where another
OL,12,Ffour people were arrested.
